<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-038" chapter-id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia" source-id="s-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia-ws1569807">
  <p id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p001:m0000" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAA">惲</persName>父<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p001:m0002" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAA">世隆</persName>彈琴，爲士流第一，<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p001:m0013" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAA">惲</persName>每奏其父曲</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p002:m0000" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAA">惲</persName>著卜杖龜經。性好醫術，盡其精妙。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">少子<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p003:m0002" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAAA">偃</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p003:m0004" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAAA">彥遊</persName>，年十二，梁武帝引見，詔問讀何書，對曰：「尚書。」又問有何美句，對曰：「德惟善政，政在養人。」眾咸異之。詔尚武帝女<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p003:m0063" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_I">長城公主</persName>，拜駙馬都尉、都亭侯，位鄱陽內史，卒。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p004:m0001" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAAAB">盼</persName>尚<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p004:m0003" ref="5ye_fwj_neh">陳文帝</persName>女<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p004:m0007" ref="5ye_fwj_neh_E">富陽公主</persName>，拜駙馬都尉。後主即位，以帝舅加散騎常侍。<persName id="c-nanshi-038-liujingyan-liujia:p004:m0032" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAAAB">盼</persName>性愚戇，使酒，因醉乘馬入殿門，爲有司劾免，卒於家。贈侍中、中護軍。</p>
</text>
